{
  "name": "Emissary of Peace",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the ability to diffuse violent situations. Whenever you make a Charisma check to calm violent emotions or to counsel peace, you have Advantage on the roll. You must make this entreaty in good faith; it doesn't apply if Proficiency in the Deception or Intimidation skill applies to your check.</p><p>You also gain Proficiency in the Performance or Persuasion skill (choose one).</p>",
